"id":1956729061464,
"title":"Thunderstorm",
"handle":"thunderstorm",
"body_html":"<p>This tea starts out dark and stormy with the pungent pu-erh giving it a musty aroma and dark flavor. The cloves add a layer of excitement and intensity as you sip at it. Then the mint gives a cooling refreshing finish after the storm. A great tea for drizzly days or restless days. </p> <p>Ingredients: Organic Pu-erh Black Tea, Cloves, Licorice Root, Peppermint</p> <p><strong></strong><strong style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><strong>Tasting Notes: Musty, thick mouthfeel, spicy</strong><br></strong></p> <p><strong style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><strong><strong>Hot: 2 tsp of tea for 8oz water. Water temperature 205. Steep for 3-4 minutes. <br></strong></strong></strong></p> <p><strong><strong>Approximately 15 tsp in a 1 ounce package. </strong></strong></p>",
